[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 93 Our new neighbour",
    "start": 0.57,
    "end": 4.752,
    "zh": "第93课 我们的新邻居",
    "zh_hant": "第93課 我們的新鄰居"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then",
    "start": 6.133,
    "end": 9.194,
    "zh": "听录音，然后",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "answer this question.",
    "start": 8.995,
    "end": 10.995,
    "zh": "回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Why is Nigel a lucky man?",
    "start": 11.976,
    "end": 15.157,
    "zh": "为什么奈杰尔是个幸运的人？",
    "zh_hant": "為什麼奈傑爾是個幸運的人？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Nigel is our new next-door neighbour.",
    "start": 17.199,
    "end": 21.08,
    "zh": "奈杰尔是我们隔壁的新邻居。",
    "zh_hant": "奈傑爾是我們隔壁的新鄰居。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "He's a pilot.",
    "start": 21.581,
    "end": 23.362,
    "zh": "他是一名飞行员。",
    "zh_hant": "他是一名飛行員。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "He was in the R.A.F.",
    "start": 24.102,
    "end": 26.923,
    "zh": "他曾在英国皇家空军服役。",
    "zh_hant": "他曾在英國皇家空軍服役。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "He will fly to New York next month.",
    "start": 28.264,
    "end": 31.746,
    "zh": "下个月他将飞往纽约。",
    "zh_hant": "下個月他將飛往紐約。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "The month after next he'll fly to Tokyo.",
    "start": 33.187,
    "end": 37.329,
    "zh": "再下个月他将飞往东京。",
    "zh_hant": "再下個月他將飛往東京。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "At the moment, he's in Madrid.",
    "start": 38.589,
    "end": 41.771,
    "zh": "此刻，他在马德里。",
    "zh_hant": "此刻，他在馬德里。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "He flew to Spain a week ago.",
    "start": 42.252,
    "end": 45.233,
    "zh": "他一周前飞往了西班牙。",
    "zh_hant": "他一週前飛往了西班牙。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "He'll return to London the week",
    "start": 46.534,
    "end": 49.716,
    "zh": "他将回伦敦，在下",
    "zh_hant": "他將回倫敦，在下"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "after next.",
    "start": 49.496,
    "end": 51.037,
    "zh": "下周。",
    "zh_hant": "下週。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "He's only forty-one years old,",
    "start": 52.098,
    "end": 55.559,
    "zh": "他只有四十一岁，",
    "zh_hant": "他只有四十一歲，"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "and he has already been to nearly",
    "start": 55.88,
    "end": 59.442,
    "zh": "而且他已经去过世界上几乎",
    "zh_hant": "而且他已經去過世界上幾乎"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "every country in the world.",
    "start": 59.482,
    "end": 62.283,
    "zh": "所有的国家。",
    "zh_hant": "所有的國家。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "Nigel is a very lucky man.",
    "start": 63.404,
    "end": 66.506,
    "zh": "奈杰尔是个非常幸运的人。",
    "zh_hant": "奈傑爾是個非常幸運的人。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "But his wife isn't very lucky.",
    "start": 67.106,
    "end": 70.088,
    "zh": "但他的妻子不是很幸运。",
    "zh_hant": "但他的妻子不是很幸運。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "She usually stays at home!",
    "start": 70.588,
    "end": 73.49,
    "zh": "她通常待在家里！",
    "zh_hant": "她通常待在家裡！"
  }
]
